---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Playlists from "../components/about/Playlists.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About me | bensparrowdev"
  description="I'm Ben, a freelance web developer from Cambridge 🇬🇧 and have been making websites for the past three years, but my passion for technology goes back much further."
  bgText="edm enthusiast"
>
  <section class="container-lg mx-auto mb-32">
    <h1>About me.</h1>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mb-32">
        <h3>
          I'm Ben, a passionate freelance web developer based in the vibrant
          city of Cambridge 🇬🇧.
        </h3>
        <h4 class="mb-6">
          I've acquired a wide range of skills and experience from my diverse
          journey in tech that make me a valuable asset to any project.
        </h4>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-9">
        <div>
          <h2 class="">
            Offering strategic technical solutions to address business
            challenges
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>
            My journey began as a digital project manager for a WordPress
            agency, where I honed my soft skills and developed a keen
            understanding of web development processes.
          </p>
          <p>
            During the pandemic, I attended a coding bootcamp to gain
            foundational web development knowledge. I then took my commitment a
            step further by completing a year-long apprenticeship in software
            development, achieving a Level 4 qualification.
          </p>
          <p>
            As an effective remote worker, I've successfully delivered results
            for clients across the UK and Europe. I'm currently working remotely
            from my home in Cambridge while actively taking on freelance
            projects.
          </p>
          <p>
            Away from my desk, I like to promote a balanced lifestyle. I'm a
            regular gym goer, Aston Villa Football Club supporter, bookworm,
            electronic music fan (see my playlists below) and a keen traveller.
          </p>
          <div class="flex gap-4 text-body dark:text-body_dark mt-8">
            <p class="mb-0">Connect with me on:</p>
            <a
              href="https://twitter.com/bensparrowdev"
              target="_blank"
              rel="external"
              aria-label="Ben Sparrow twitter profile"
            >
              <i
                class="fa-brands fa-twitter fa-xl hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary_dark transition-colors duration-150 ease-in"
              ></i>
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ben-sparrow/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="external"
              aria-label="Ben Sparrow linkedin profile"
            >
              <i
                class="fa-brands fa-linkedin-in fa-xl hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary_dark transition-colors duration-150 ease-in"
              ></i>
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/bensparrowdev"
              target="_blank"
              rel="external"
              aria-label="Ben Sparrow Github repositories"
            >
              <i
                class="fa-brands fa-github fa-xl hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-primary_dark transition-colors duration-150 ease-in"
              ></i>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="container-lg mx-auto pb-12" id="playlists">
      <h3 class="text-left">What I listen to</h3>
      <Playlists />
    </section>
  </section>
</Layout>
